*  SN4-CONSTANTS T1 -- scalar constant fold.
*  A declared &Name whose RHS is a literal (integer, real, or string)
*  must lower as the LITERAL ITSELF at every read site: zero runtime
*  keyword machinery, zero spine carve, zero PLT call.
*  ORACLE_FAIL BY CONSTRUCTION: stock sbl 251s &USER_DECLARED_CONSTANTS
*  and any &-prefixed user name, so this .ref is SCRIP-pinned.
        &USER_DECLARED_CONSTANTS = 1
        &N = 42
        &Pi = 3.14
        &Tag = 'hello'
        OUTPUT = &N
        OUTPUT = &Pi
        OUTPUT = &Tag
        OUTPUT = &N + 1
        OUTPUT = &Tag ' world'
END
